    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27(1) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Dissanayake MudiyanselageSumanaweera Banda Dissanayake, Minister of Higher Education, do by this order, on the recommendation of the UniversityGrants Commission, amend the Order made under Section 21 of the aforesaid Act, establishing the South Eastern Universityof Sri Lanka and published in Gazette Extraordinary, No. 916/7 of March 27, 1996, as last amended by Order published inGazette Extraordinary, No. 1787/27 of December 05, 2012 by the addition immediately after item (b) in Column II under theheading \u201cDepartment of Study\u201d which correspond to the entry \u201cFaculty of Management and Commerce\u201d in Column I underthe heading \u201cFaculty\u201d in the Schedule II to such order, of the following new item :-",
